# Documentation only: the distributed application does not read .env files.
# Never place passwords, activation codes, private keys or tokens in this file,
# Java arguments, source code or resources. There are no client AWS credentials.
# Optional NON-SECRET Java system properties (before -jar):
# -Dintegrator.api=https://api.example.invalid
# -Dintegrator.installation=<installation UUID>
# -Dintegrator.run=<authorized receiving run UUID>
# -Dintegrator.keystore=<local identity.jceks path>
# -Dintegrator.output=exports
# -Dintegrator.cutoff=2026-10-08
# -Dintegrator.pageSize=1000
# -Dintegrator.timeoutSeconds=30
# source_version is read from tb_config_sistema (VERSAOBANCODADOS).
# Enter database credentials, the local keystore password and first-use
# activation code interactively in Swing. Never distribute a populated keystore.
